Date: Tue, 24 Mar 2026 21:15:17 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] add tpk_wdt

---
 drivers/watchdog/Kconfig   |   5 +
 drivers/watchdog/Makefile  |   3 +
 drivers/watchdog/tpk_wdt.c | 491 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 linux.config               |   1 +
 4 files changed, 500 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/watchdog/tpk_wdt.c

diff --git a/drivers/watchdog/Kconfig b/drivers/watchdog/Kconfig
